EMF is the total energy supplied per coulomb by the source before any internal loss is removed.

9
00:00:58.640 --> 00:01:05.970
Delivered lift means terminal p.d..

10
00:01:05.970 --> 00:01:13.300
The external circuit receives the terminal p.d., not always the full emf.

11
00:01:13.300 --> 00:01:19.974
This diagram matters because the picture matters because every later equation is really describing this one split route.

12
00:01:19.974 --> 00:01:26.648
Open circuit shows that With no current, there is no internal voltage drop, so the terminal p.d.

13
