Loaded circuit shows that When current flows, the internal resistance steals part of the source lift inside the battery.

15
00:01:39.996 --> 00:01:46.670
Reading habit shows that Compare full lift and delivered lift before choosing any equation.

16
00:01:46.670 --> 00:01:53.344
The source picture is one split: full emf, internal drop, and terminal delivery.

17
00:01:53.344 --> 00:02:00.018
Keep this takeaway in view: The source picture is one split: full emf, internal drop, and terminal delivery.

